msgctxt "#32212"
msgid "Shows you are rewatching on Trakt match your rewatch progress in Kodi. Episodes watched since the rewatch started are marked watched, and the rest unwatched. Start a rewatch from a show's context menu or on Trakt."
msgstr "Reekse wat jy op Trakt herkyk, volg in Kodi jou herkykvordering. Episodes wat sedert die begin van die herkyk gekyk is, word as gekyk gemerk, en die res as ongekyk. Begin 'n herkyk vanuit 'n reeks se kontekskieslys of op Trakt."

