msgstr "Kyk tans"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Die Trakt-byvoeging is ook geaktiveer. Albei byvoegings scrobble en sinkroniseer met Trakt, so alles word twee keer gedoen."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Hou albei"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Begin herkyk"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Begin 'n herkyk op Trakt? Jou vordering begin weer van voor af, en elke episode word in Kodi as ongekyk gemerk."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Herkyk het begin"

msgctxt "#32223"
msgid "Couldn't start rewatch"
msgstr "Kon nie herkyk begin nie"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Gebruik die OG Trakt-tema"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Wys Trakt se rooi logo, harte en uitligkleure, soos op og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "%i kon nie gesinkroniseer word nie"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Jou Trakt-rekening is gesluit. Kontak Trakt-ondersteuning."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Kyklyslimiet van %i bereik"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Kies wat om te sinkroniseer"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Maak die sinkroniseringsopstelling oop wat gewys word nadat jy aan Trakt gekoppel het."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Sinkroniseer wanneer Kodi 'n biblioteekskandering of -skoonmaak voltooi. Andersins loop 'n sinkronisering slegs wanneer jy dit begin, soos vanuit die kontekskieslys."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Gee kennis wanneer 'n sinkronisering na 'n biblioteekskandering of -skoonmaak begin en klaarmaak."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Wys geen sinkroniseringkennisgewings terwyl 'n video speel nie."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Pas items sonder 'n IMDb-, TMDB- of TVDB-ID volgens titel en jaar, tydens scrobbling en sinkronisering. Word nooit gebruik om items as ongekyk te merk of graderings te wis nie."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Gekykstatus"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Trakt na Kodi: Kodi stem ooreen met Trakt, speeltellings en datums ingesluit, en enigiets sonder speelbeurte op Trakt word as ongekyk gemerk. Kodi na Trakt: items wat in Kodi gekyk is sonder 'n speelbeurt op Trakt, word by sy geskiedenis gevoeg. Albei rigtings: elke kant kry die speelbeurte wat dit kortkom, en niks word buite 'n Trakt-herkyk as ongekyk gemerk nie."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Af"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Trakt na Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Kodi na Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "Albei rigtings"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Graderings"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Flieks, reekse en episodes"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Trakt na Kodi: Kodi stem ooreen met Trakt, en graderings wat Trakt nie het nie, word in Kodi gewis. Kodi na Trakt: Kodi se graderings word by Trakt gevoeg en vervang dié wat verskil. Albei rigtings: ontbrekende graderings word na albei kante gekopieer, en waar hulle verskil, word Trakt s'n behou."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Hervatpunte van Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Kodi hervat waar Trakt die item gepouseer het, soos vanaf 'n ander toestel. Terugspeel in Kodi stuur steeds sy vordering na Trakt wanneer dit af is."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Byvoeg"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Byvoeg en verwyder"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Byvoeg: Kodi se items word by die Trakt-versameling gevoeg. Byvoeg en verwyder: versamelde items wat Kodi nie het nie, word ook daaruit verwyder, insluitend dié van ander toestelle of toepassings."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Relay scrobble altyd wanneer dit gekoppel is. Sinkronisering hanteer wat dit nie gescrobble het nie: ander toestelle, ouer geskiedenis."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Aan"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Gekykstatus word nie gesinkroniseer nie."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Kodi stem ooreen met Trakt, speeltellings en datums ingesluit. Enigiets sonder speelbeurte op Trakt word in Kodi as ongekyk gemerk."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Items wat in Kodi gekyk is sonder 'n speelbeurt op Trakt, word by sy geskiedenis gevoeg. Kodi word nie verander nie."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Elke kant kry die speelbeurte wat dit kortkom, en niks word buite 'n Trakt-herkyk as ongekyk gemerk nie."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Graderings word nie gesinkroniseer nie."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Kodi se graderings stem ooreen met Trakt, en graderings wat Trakt nie het nie, word in Kodi gewis."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Kodi se graderings word by Trakt gevoeg en vervang dié wat verskil. Kodi word nie verander nie."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Ontbrekende graderings word na albei kante gekopieer. Waar hulle verskil, word Trakt se gradering behou."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Kodi behou sy eie hervatpunte."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Kodi hervat waar Trakt die item gepouseer het, soos vanaf 'n ander toestel."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "'n Sinkronisering loop slegs wanneer jy dit begin, soos vanuit die kontekskieslys."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Sinkroniseer wanneer Kodi 'n biblioteekskandering of -skoonmaak voltooi."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Stoor en sinkroniseer"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i items in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Merk %i items in Kodi as ongekyk om met Trakt ooreen te stem?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Wis %i graderings in Kodi om met Trakt ooreen te stem?"
